"{\"status\":\"changes_required\",\"reviewed_aspects\":[\"request_coverage\",\"lifecycle_and_progress\",\"payload_and_dependencies\",\"verification_consistency\",\"observation_sufficiency\",\"unresolved_assumptions\"],\"findings\":[{\"id\":\"F_RESPONSE_TOP_BINDINGS_MISSING\",\"scope\":\"architecture\",\"message\":\"The host_adapter response outputs are declared and driven from memory response storage, but the structural graph has no connections from host_adapter.rsp_valid and host_adapter.rsp_rdata to top.rsp_valid and top.rsp_rdata. The recorded architecture validation also identifies those top sinks as undriven and the adapter outputs as unused. Consequently, committed READ responses cannot reach the required host-visible response ports, and response-delivery bindings at the top cannot distinguish the claimed behavior. Add the missing structural top-level response connections and rerun architecture validation.\",\"references\":[\"/documents/graph/connections\",\"/documents/modules/contracts/host_adapter/interfaces/rsp_valid\",\"/documents/modules/contracts/host_adapter/interfaces/rsp_rdata\",\"/documents/shared/host_interface/rsp_valid\",\"/documents/shared/host_interface/rsp_rdata\",\"/package/generation/validation_repairs/2\"],\"requirement_ids\":[\"R6\",\"BASE_DATA\",\"BASE_HOST\"]},{\"id\":\"F_PROFILE_PROVENANCE_UNRESOLVED\",\"scope\":\"system\",\"message\":\"The selected DDR4-3200 timing values are present, but their authoritative provenance and acceptance remain explicitly marked requires_review and the package retains an open question blocking design review. Compiler checks and planned timing-boundary verification can confirm implementation against the supplied values but cannot establish that the external timing-library source is authoritative. Obtain and record the required external profile-source review or disposition before RTL generation; do not treat the populated numeric library as evidence that this assumption is resolved.\",\"references\":[\"/package/assumptions/A_PROFILE\",\"/package/open_questions/Q_PROFILE_PROVENANCE\",\"/documents/shared/timing_profile\",\"/timing_library/DDR4-3200\",\"/documents/system/rules/BASE_TIMING\"],\"requirement_ids\":[\"BASE_TIMING\",\"BASE_TRRD\",\"BASE_TFAW\",\"R5\"]}]}"
